  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: ສະຫຼຸບສັ້ນໆ, ຂ້ອຍແມ່ນຜູ້ຊ່ວຍສ່ວນຕົວແລະໝູ່ສະໜິດຂອງທ່ານ.<br/>ພ້ອມເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການ.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: ສະບາຍດີ, ຂ້ອຍແມ່ນ Cortana.<br/>ຂ້ອຍຈະເຮັດໃຫທຸກຢ່າງໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນແລະຊ່ວຍທ່ານໃນທຸກໆຢ່າງ.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: Cortana ແມ່ນຄູ່ຫູຂອງທ່ານ, ພ້ອມຊ່ວຍໃນທຸກເລື່ອງທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານດີເລີດ, ເປັນພະເອກ ຫຼືພຽງແຕ່ໃຫ້ທັນເວລາ.<br/><br/>ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Cortana ໃຫ້ປະສົບການແບບເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, Microsoft ເກັບເອົາ ແລະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ ລວມທັງທີ່ຕັ້ງ ແລະປະຫວັດທີ່ຕັ້ງ, ລາຍຊື່ຕິດຕໍ່, ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍສຽງ, ຮູບແບບການສັ່ງງານດ້ວຍສຽງ ແລະ ການຂຽນດ້ວຍມື, ປະຫວັດການພິມ, ປະຫວັດການຄົ້ນຫາ, ລາຍລະອຽດປະຕິທິນ, ເນື້ອໃນ ແລະປະຫວັດການສື່ສານຂອງທ່ານ ຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະແອັບ, ແລະຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໃນອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານ. ໃນ Microsoft Edge, Cortana ເກັບເອົາ ແລະໃຊ້ປະຫວັດການທ່ອງເວັບຂອງທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດບາງຢ່າງໄດ້ສະເໝີ ດ້ວຍສິ່ງທີ່ Cortana ຈື່ໃນສະໝຸດບັນທຶກ ແລະ ປິດໃຊ້ງານ Cortana ໃນ Microsoft Edge ໄດ້.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: ປ້ອນ​ລະຫັດ​ຜ່ານຂອງ​ທ່ານ
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: ​ເພື່ອ​ຄວາມ​ປອດ​​ໄພ, ກະລຸນາ​ປ້ອນ​ລະຫັດ​ຜ່ານ​ຂອງ​ທ່ານ​ອີກ​ຄັ້ງ​ໜຶ່ງ.
  \MicrosoftInternalMetadata\ContentChecksumValue:
